mage\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/dd2a1a77-c66d-4244-99ba-eab6c7526c7b\" />\n\nWith theme:\n<img width=\"320\" height=\"203\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/3953b274-73dd-410d-b8e0-6e4b2d6b63da\" />\n\nGodot v4.4.1.stable:\n<img width=\"471\" height=\"241\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/8eb58e3e-abe3-42cb-bc80-9b68dfef16d1\" />\n\nWith theme:\n<img width=\"443\" height=\"221\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/8280e709-8e84-4c2f-afe4-00c12d983b7a\" />\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nOpen Godot and try to delete some object within scene\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109461/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109461/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"not_planned","pinned_comment":null}